EXAMPLE WITH A DUTY ON A PUBLIC BODY (made up, for the format only)
Rule: "Where a list of approved carriers changes, each Member State shall publish it."
Answer: {"duty_type": "duty", "roles": ["public body"], "if": [{"logic": "all", "items": [{"text": "a list of approved carriers changes", "kind": "process_fact"}]}], "then": "the Member State must publish the list", "exceptions": [], "special_cases": []}

